Sinnoh_SunyshoreCityWestHouse_Text_Person1:
	.string "We're all waiting for VOLKNER to\n"
	.string "battle us. He's been in a slump lately.$"

Sinnoh_SunyshoreCityWestHouse_Text_Person2:
	.string "I make the kids laugh while they wait.\n"
	.string "Look, a POKé BALL behind your ear!$"

Sinnoh_SunyshoreCityWestHouse_Text_Person3:
	.string "VOLKNER's the strongest LEADER in\n"
	.string "SINNOH. That's why he's last!$"

Sinnoh_SunyshoreCityWestHouse_Text_Person4:
	.string "I bring snacks for the kids. Waiting is\n"
	.string "hungry work.$"

Sinnoh_SunyshoreCityWestHouse_Text_Person5:
	.string "I'm going to be the first one to beat\n"
	.string "VOLKNER this year! ...After you, maybe.$"

Sinnoh_SunyshoreCityWestHouse_Text_Person6:
	.string "VOLKNER waved at me once! I didn't\n"
	.string "wash that hand for a week.$"

Sinnoh_SunyshoreCityWestHouse_Text_Person7:
	.string "Electric MOéMON are the coolest. Zap\n"
	.string "zap!$"

